  24K/48K (student build; env knobs NEMESIS_TOOL_RESULT_CHARS/_TURN_CHARS).
  One inbox-dump session burned a full 1.5M-token day (2026-07-14); oversized
  results already persist to disk with a preview, so nothing is lost — the
  agent reads slices on demand. Tests updated to the student contract; full
  tools suite verified no new failures vs baseline (68 pre-existing, same
